    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goppy is a cute little fish who loves eating his yummy green treats, but he needs help to avoid the nippy-creepy-crawlies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Goppy&quot; is a simple and short casual game, designed to be relaxing and fun.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy-to-pick-up gameplay will help you wind down and get immersed quickly, and lovingly drawn graphics give the impression of a tropical paradise.\u00a0   <br>You can adjust the difficulty from a relaxing &quot;Casual&quot; up to a crazily challenging &quot;FUN&quot; mode.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Endless&quot; mode you can compete with players from around the world for the first place on the global leaderboard.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goppy is a cute little fish who loves eating his yummy green treats, but he needs help to avoid the nippy-creepy-crawlies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Goppy&quot; is a simple and short casual game, designed to be relaxing and fun.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy-to-pick-up gameplay will help you wind down and get immersed quickly, and lovingly drawn graphics give the impression of a tropical paradise.\u00a0   <br>You can adjust the difficulty from a relaxing &quot;Casual&quot; up to a crazily challenging &quot;FUN&quot; mode.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Endless&quot; mode you can compete with players from around the world for the first place on the global leaderboard.</p>",
    "short_description": "Goppy is a cute little fish who loves eating his yummy green treats, but he needs help to avoid the nippy-creepy-crawlies. With its vibrant graphics and easy-to-pick-up gameplay, &quot;Goppy&quot; feels like a holiday.",
